      "Shows safer replacements for any using unknown, generics, and type guards.",
      "Explains null handling, indexed access checks, and optional chaining under strict null checks.",
      "Provides typescript-eslint rule guidance for unsafe assignments, member access, calls, and returns.",
      "Offers review checklists for any, ignored errors, casts, null checks, and return types."
    ],
